      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "POUND KEEPING (4) goes very well this course and distance starting 12 times for seven wins and four minors. Was out of the placings last time (30.22) at Richmond in a NG, finishing eighth and beaten 7 lengths. Looks suited and should go close. WINSOME JET (3) was quickly out of the tricky draw with a fast early sectional and clocked 29.60 with a 1.3 lengths win at this track over 520m. In sparkling form and looks the one to beat again. O'KEEFE (1) was in the money last time at The Meadows (30.23) in a Mix 3/4, finishing a 6 length second. Loves this draw, having won six of 10 starts. Among the main chances. FASTENED (2) scored by 4 lengths last time (25.54) in a Grade 4/5 over 457m at Temora. Has already won two times from this draw.",
